<title>USA: Eltron Intl, Zebra plan merger.</title>
<headline>Eltron Intl, Zebra plan merger.</headline>
<dateline>SIMI VALLEY, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Eltron International Inc Zebra Technologies Corp said Wednesday they have signed a letter of intent to merge in a transaction in which each of Zebra's common shares will be exchanged for 0.84 shares of Eltron common stock.</p>
<p>Donald Skinner, chief executive officer of Eltron International, will become president and chief executive officer of the combined company.</p>
<p>Edward Kaplan, chairman and chief executive officer of Zebra Technologies, will serve as its chairman.</p>
